OL,5,G0010 999: On the Front Line
OL,6,     FParamedics treat an 11-month-old
OL,7,     Fbaby with a dangerously high
OL,8,     Ftemperature, a teenager with
OL,9,     Fsuspected appendicitis, and a
OL,10,     Fwoman whose blood pressure is
OL,11,     Fcritical.
OL,12,G0115 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FOn his way to his first day at
OL,14,     Fsecondary school, 11-year-old Jack
OL,15,     Fhas been hit by a motorbike. He
OL,16,     Fmanaged to push his friend out of
OL,17,     Fthe way but has sustained a
OL,18,     Ffractured skull.
